**hook.hpp connects engine detours to the controller runtime.**

## Interface

- `gamepad::unstable::controller::engine::install(runtime&) -> void`
- `runtime` is forward-declared; `types.hpp` and `utility.hpp` supply support types/utilities.

## Design

`install` centralizes engine addresses, detour metadata, trampolines, and QoS bridging, including PC key-name conversion, `CL_MouseMove` augmentation, and verified delta-usercmd callsites.